        text = "Summons 1 Guardian into the battlefield.\nFor every Guardian alive on the battlefield, Rinne gets 1 stack of [Untouchable]: +5% DMG, +5% Crit Rate and +5% Pierce Rate. Up to 3 Guardians can exist at once (when there are 3 Guardians, new Guardian will replace an existing one).\nGuardian Abilities:\nBlack Guardian:\nSkill 1: Summon a bolt of lighting in front that attacks enemies within its range.\nSkill 2: Launch a shockwave forward, attacking enemies in a straight line.\nSkill 3: Reduce the Movement Speed of nearby enemies by 20%.\nRed Guardian:\nSkill 1: Summon a magic circle. When Rinne stands inside it, she gains +10% DMG MIT.\nSkill 2: Create a Realm that deals DoT to enemies inside of it. Rinne heals for 2% of max HP per second when the Realm deals damage.\nSkill 3: All Guardians gain +90% DMG MIT.\nWhite Guardian:\nSkill 1: Send enemies into the Void, then pull them back into reality at a distant spot.\nSkill 2: Launch a shockwave forward, inflicting Stasis on enemies in a straight line.\nSkill 3: After appearing, Rinne becomes invisible for 5s.\n(Guardians inherit the following stats from Rinne: 30% of HP, 80% of ATK/Crit Rate/Pierce Rate/Crit DMG/Pierce DMG and 100% of DEF)\nAfter taking DMG, Guardians gain DMG Immunity for 1s. Trigger Interval: 0.5s.",
