    [18000003] = {
        id = 18000003,
        text = "Commander has assigned work to Kannazuki again!\n1. Challenge Nian Beasts, Drop Event, and gather gifts in the Garden Party to earn materials for making fireworks.\n2. After gathering enough materials, select a mould, and tap \"Craft\" to command the diligent Kannazuki to craft the materials into fireworks for you. Success rate: 100%.\n3. You exchange Sparks with your friends for more molds.\n4. Enter the \"Player Info\" UI of your friend and then tap \"Exchange\" for exchange.\n5. Players cannot receive exchange invites while in combat or on a date.\n6. If a party has confirmed the exchange and then they are disconnected from the server, the items will be sent by mail.\n7. There is no limitation on the number of mould exchanges.\n8. In the \"Storage Room\" you can check your fireworks.\n9. To set off fireworks, tap the Smile button in the lower right corner of the Garden Party UI, and then select fireworks to set off from your \"Item\" inventory.",
