    [15011000] = {
        id = 15011000,
        text = "\"Heitao Game License and Service Agreement\" (hereinafter referred to as \"this Agreement\") is concluded between the user and service provider, Heitao Interactive, and this Agreement shall have the effect of a contract. User shall read carefully and fully understand the contents of each clause, in particular the clauses exempting or limiting the liabilities of Heitao, the clauses limiting the rights of user, the clauses on the dispute settlement method and jurisdiction, and the separate agreements for opening or usage of the service. \nUser shall not use Heitao Game and its services unless they have read and accepted all the clauses of this Agreement. Using the Heitao Game and its services shall be deemed to indicate that they have read and agreed to sign this Agreement. \nUser who is under the age of 18 should read this Agreement with their legal guardian and pay special attention to terms in regarding to Use for Juvenile. \nImportant Note: \n(I) User should read the clauses of the \"Heitao Game License and Service Agreement\" (hereinafter referred to as \" this Agreement\") carefully before using Heitao Game and related services. Heitao Interactive hereby specifically reminds user to carefully read all clauses of this Agreement, in particular the clauses that exempt or limit the liabilities of Heitao (these clauses usually contain terms like \"shall not be liable\" and \"no obligation\") and other clauses that limit the rights of user (these clauses usually contain terms like \"shall not\"), these clauses shall be applied to the maximum extent permitted by Chinese laws. \n(II) If user disagrees with the clauses of this Agreement, please do not install or use this software or related services. Once user click \"accept\" and install this software, or register and begin or continue to use this software or related services, they are deemed to have accepted all the clauses of this Agreement. Thereafter, user shall not raise any defense of any kind on grounds of not reading the contents of this Agreement or the like. \n(II) During use of this software and related services, user has the right to supervise whether Heitao Interactive and its staff are providing services to user in accordance with the standards published by Heitao Interactive, they can also put forward related opinions and suggestions regarding Heitao Interactive products and services at any time.\n",
